### Batch Gate System
- **Code gate** in `classify_art_v2.py`: `check_batch_gate()` blocks batches >10 games if gate closed. `close_batch_gate()` auto-closes after every batch. `update_gate_from_regression()` auto-opens if ALL per-dimension gates pass + fixes applied. No bypass flag.
- **Per-dimension gates** (IMPLEMENTED — `GATE_THRESHOLDS` in code, OK%-based):
  - theme ≥87% OK, characters ≥85% OK, elements ≥60% OK, color_tone ≥88% OK, overall ≥80% OK
  - All currently PASSING. These are regression-catch thresholds, not aspirational targets.
- **Gate file** `art_pipeline/batch_gate.json`: Missing = CLOSED (fail-safe). `gate_open` defaults to false.
- **Cursor rule** `.cursor/rules/art-pipeline-gates.mdc`: Always-applied stop-fix-verify cycle.
- **Thresholds**: ≥85% spot-check auto-open after fixes; 75-84% needs fixes+verification; <75% escalate
- **Spot-check size**: 20 games per batch (minimum)

